# The uspace-core tag src/model mirrors (scripts/check-enums.sh reads the
# first line). Bumping it is its own `build:` commit that runs the check.
#
# Listed skips: a kit value absent from core at this tag that the check
# reports as a visible skip instead of a failure. Anything else absent on
# either side fails. A listed value that core has gained fails too, so the
# line is removed when the tag is bumped.
#
# Types are named as package.Type (core.Trust, alerting.ClearReason,
# sources.Why); a skip line is: skip <package.Type> <value> <why>.
skip alerting.ClearReason acknowledged_timeout spec 04 §3.3 names it; core's alerting raises no acknowledgement timeout (the kit renders it when an app's API sends it)
